# TASK/LDG-M3 run A (finding B1, with the AES trace kernel) -- a SHORT mouse
# click on [Compute] and then a LONG press (0.8 s) on it. WinDom passes
# bclicks 258 / bmask 3 / bstate 0 to evnt_multi (globals.c EVNTvar evnt) and
# acts on a button event only if `evnt.mbut & 0x01` (evnt_windom.c:334).
# Expected on NewTOS: the short click returns EV_MB = 0 (released by the end
# of the double-click window) and is dropped; the long press returns EV_MB = 1
# and opens the info alert. The client's Pterm (Return twice: alert OK, then
# the DEFAULT button Close) writes C:\AESTRACE.BIN.
# Window geometry from probe-on-t35.png: Compute (236..303, 259..278).
100 parkbr
1600 mark S00_WINDOW
1700 move 269 268
1800 down
1806 up
2400 mark S01_SHORTCLICK
2600 down
2760 up
3200 mark S02_LONGPRESS
3800 key 1C
3806 key 9C
4200 mark S03_ALERT_GONE
4400 key 1C
4406 key 9C
5200 mark END_CLOSED
